# API Documentation

## Swagger / API Reference

The backend API documentation is available at:

**https://arsplatform.onrender.com/swagger/index.html**

Use this link to:
- View all available API endpoints
- Check request/response schemas
- See authentication requirements
- Test API calls directly

All FE development should reference this Swagger documentation when:
- Creating API service files
- Defining TypeScript interfaces/types for API payloads
- Understanding which endpoints to call
